{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Period Tracker &amp; Pregnancy App 是一款專注於保護私隱的智能月經週期與懷孕追蹤工具，適合重視個人健康數據安全的女性用戶。該應用現正提供終生版限時免費領取機會，原價為 US $12.99，讓你能以零成本獲得專業級的健康管理體驗。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-60.webp\">\n<h2>全方位智能健康追蹤</h2>\n<p>內置智能預測算法，精準推算排卵期與下次月經時間。支援症狀記錄、孕期每週發展跟蹤及產縮計時器，符合 5-1-1 規則自動警報。所有數據僅存於本地 iPhone，確保零雲端上傳與無第三方追蹤，兼顧便利與極致私隱保護。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-484-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-485-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-486-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-487-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-488-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Period Tracker &amp; Pregnancy App 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Period Tracker &amp; Pregnancy App</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T01:04:02.276035+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":439,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:38:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:58:41.910131+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:58:24.475200+00:00","content_hash":"07d2aef6fe30919561f068ce17fc1bb43a7b5530885afcb9dba6ae44ccc44334","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}